  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="hero-eyebrow">LAOSHI · 个人软件作品集</p><h1 id="hero-title">终身<span class="hero-accent">求知</span>，<br>以诚<span class="hero-accent">对话</span>。</h1><p class="hero-lead">在实践中学习，把所学做成作品；在交流中分享，让想法与理解相遇。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#works">浏览作品</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/emperorStorm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div><dl class="hero-stats"><div><dt>作品</dt><dd>{{ works.length }}</dd></div><div><dt>覆盖平台</dt><dd>{{ platforms }}</dd></div><div><dt>本地优先</dt><dd>{{ works.filter(work => work.localFirst).length }}</dd></div></dl></div><aside class="hero-aside" aria-label="师说题记"><div class="hero-aside-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="hero-vertical"><span>学无止境</span><span>彼此为师</span></p><img class="hero-seal" src="/brand/laoshi-mark.svg" alt="师说印记" width="88" height="88"><p class="hero-aside-note">EST. 2026 · LEARN & SHARE</p></aside></div><div class="container hero-foot"><span>Keep learning. Connect through dialogue.</span><span>向下浏览 ↓</span></div></section>
  <section id="works" class="section works" aria-labelledby="works-title"><div class="container"><header class="section-head"><span class="section-no" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div class="section-title-group"><p class="section-kicker">SELECTED WORKS</p><h2 id="works-title">作品</h2></div><p class="section-desc">六件作品，覆盖桌面、移动与 Web 服务。每一件都从一个真实的小问题开始。</p></header><div class="works-toolbar"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="按形态筛选作品"><button v-for="filter in filters" :key="filter.key" class="filter" :class="{ 'is-active': active === filter.key }" type="button" :aria-pressed="active === filter.key" @click="active = filter.key">{{ filter.label }} <span>{{ works.filter(work => filter.key === 'all' || work.category === filter.key).length }}</span></button></div><p class="filter-status" aria-live="polite">显示 {{ filtered.length }} 件作品</p></div><div class="works-grid"><WorkCard v-for="work in filtered" :key="work.slug" :work="work" :index="works.indexOf(work)" @preview="preview?.open($event)" /></div></div></section>
